to include as dependencies.\r\nWhen trying to build the project it fails\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nIt should build and start\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\nBuild fails without any clear reason.\r\n\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1.  Create a sample quarkus project with gradle as a build tool\r\n2.  Create a lib folder in your project, add some jar\r\n(I have downloaded the appache commons lang3)\r\n\r\n3.  Add a flat dir repository to your build.gradle file, like:\r\nflatDir {\r\n        name = 'Local lib'\r\n        dir file('lib')\r\n    }\r\n4.  Add a dependency in your project like:\r\nimplementation ':commons-lang3-3.9'\r\n\r\n**Note**\r\nI ran the quarkusBuild target with **--stacktrace** and it gives this error:\r\n\r\n`Caused by: java.lang.ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException: 2\r\n\tat io.quarkus.gradle.AppModelGradleResolver.toAppDependency(AppModelGradleResolver.java:194)\r\n\tat io.quarkus.gradle.AppModelGradleResolver.resolveModel(AppModelGradleResolver.java:134)`\r\n\r\nSo I think it must be an issue with the quarkus gradle plugin.","closed_by":{"login":"gastaldi","id":54133,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MTMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54133?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gastaldi","html_url":"https://github.com/gastaldi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gastaldi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gastaldi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gastaldi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gastaldi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gastaldi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gastaldi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gastaldi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gastaldi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gastaldi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type"